From da5134350edf90e95f57e0e2f099da66e73ca834 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] FIPS Canister Plugins: Add self tests

Self tests for FIPS canister GCC plugins.

Under pad_canister_structs/match_canister_structs,
run ./self-test.sh. Or, from the main self-test directory,
run ./run_tests.sh.

Common functions are in self-test-lib.sh.

Mostly validates GCC/pahole output against
expected output.

When changing ANY code in either FIPS canister
plugin, please run this test suite, and add any
new test cases which are needed.

Note: In order to run self tests, you must first
edit CANISTER_LOC in dwarf_debuginfo_parser.c
(for match_canister_struct) to be the absolute path
to the FIPS canister .o file. (and rebuild the plugin).

Signed-off-by: Brennan Lamoreaux <brennan.lamoreaux@broadcom.com>
